  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 20px 18px 26px; background-color: #f2e7d3; background-image: url(\u0026#34;data:image/png;base64,\u0026#34;); background-repeat: repeat; background-size: 160px 160px; color: #413124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 20px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0 0 -10px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; height: 18px; margin: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"padding: 18px 16px 14px; background-color: #fffcf5; border: 1px dashed #b8915c; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #d8c3a0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #4a3728; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0\"\u003e撕一小段斜纹和纸胶带，把今天遇到的灵感、书摘与照片一一贴进手账本里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px dashed #c29d6a\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; width: 24px; height: 24px; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #b85a32; color: #fffaf2; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 8px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: inline; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #3d2b1d\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e把零碎日常拼成一本纪念册\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #413124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 14px\"\u003e点阵牛皮纸自带手作温度，\u003cstrong style=\"color: #9b4d2b; font-weight: 700\"\u003e圆章序号、虚线便签与拍立得相框\u003c/strong\u003e让图文轻快鲜活。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #fff8e6; border: 1px solid #dbb978; border-left: 4px solid #b85a32; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #dfd0b4\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #b85a32; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eMEMO //\u003c/span\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #543d2a; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0\"\u003e记录不是为了完美，而是为了记住那天阳光的角度。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 20px 4px; padding: 10px 10px 24px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d5c4a8; box-shadow: 3px 4px 0 #d5c1a0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg\" alt=\"书桌上的笔记本与咖啡\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; margin-top: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #8e7558\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eJOURNAL SNAP\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px dashed #c29d6a\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; width: 24px; height: 24px; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #b85a32; color: #fffaf2; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 8px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: inline; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #3d2b1d\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e手账风排版的活力元素\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 14px 0; padding: 12px 14px; background-color: #fdf8ec; border: 1px dashed #cca978; border-radius: 6px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: #413124; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e和纸胶带装饰卷首卡片\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e暖黄 MEMO 便签框突出金句\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e拍立得白底相框带硬投影\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 16px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: #413124; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #e6d5b8; border: 1px solid #ccb592; color: #5a3721; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e维度\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #e6d5b8; border: 1px solid #ccb592; color: #5a3721; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e版式表现\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fdf9f0; border: 1px solid #d5c1a1; color: #413124; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e底纹材质\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fdf9f0; border: 1px solid #d5c1a1; color: #413124; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e点阵复古牛皮纸 PNG\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fdf9f0; border: 1px solid #d5c1a1; color: #413124; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e图片容器\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fdf9f0; border: 1px solid #d5c1a1; color: #413124; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e拍立得立式白框\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0; padding: 12px 14px; background-color: #fffcf5; border: 1px dashed #b8915c; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #6c523c; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0; text-align: center\"\u003e翻开这一页，像拆开一封寄给未来的手写明信片。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
